# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Dialog flow definitions
#  These define WHAT HAPPENS when a user intent is detected
#  Colang v1 DSL — NeMo Guardrails
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Core flows ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

define flow greeting
  user express greeting
  bot express greeting

define flow answer medical
  user ask medical question
  bot answer medical question

define flow capabilities
  user ask about capabilities
  bot inform capabilities

define flow bot identity
  user ask about bot identity
  bot inform about identity

# ── Safety flows — HIGHEST PRIORITY ──────────────────────────────────

define flow handle crisis
  user express crisis
  bot respond to crisis

define flow block dangerous requests
  user ask dangerous question
  bot refuse dangerous

define flow block off-topic
  user ask off-topic question
  bot refuse off-topic

define flow redirect diagnosis
  user request personal diagnosis
  bot respond to personal diagnosis request
